stateDiagram-v2
 [*] --> WAITING_INPUT
 WAITING_INPUT --> VALIDATING_INPUT
 VALIDATING_INPUT --> INPUT_REJECTED: invalid
 VALIDATING_INPUT --> READY_FOR_REVIEW: valid
 READY_FOR_REVIEW --> ANALYZING_VIDEO
 ANALYZING_VIDEO --> REVIEW_PARTIAL
 REVIEW_PARTIAL --> BUILDING_QA_REPORT
 BUILDING_QA_REPORT --> NEEDS_HUMAN_REVIEW: uncertain
 BUILDING_QA_REPORT --> READY_FOR_DECISION: sufficient
 READY_FOR_DECISION --> PASS: no blockers and thresholds pass
 READY_FOR_DECISION --> FAIL: blocker/threshold fail
 PASS --> LOCKED
 FAIL --> LOCKED
 NEEDS_HUMAN_REVIEW --> LOCKED: human decision
 LOCKED --> EXPORTING
 EXPORTING --> EXPORTED
